# Two separate web builds (agreed 2026-07-29)

Ship **two separate web apps**, not one mixed product. Mobile consumer is the UX source of truth.

## Route split (live)

| App | Base path | Scope |
|-----|-----------|--------|
| **Consumer** | `/app` | Exact mobile consumer — Home, Card, Connections, Follow-ups, Capture, Scan. **No business.** |
| **Business** | `/business` | Card creation + Contacts CRM · Activate · Outbound. Labeled **business / not consumer pilot**. |

Legacy `/app/contacts`, `/app/activate`, `/app/outbound` redirect into `/business/*`.

## Rules for agents

- Do not put Contacts CRM, Activate, HubSpot, campaigns, team workspace, or Outbound under `/app`.
- Consumer web mirrors mobile consumer only.
- Business web stays under `/business` (BusinessShell), including card create/edit at `/business/cards` and `/business/card/edit`.
- Shared platform (auth, Postgres, public `/c` and `/e`) can stay; **product surfaces stay separate**.
